  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Mohd Abbas Kureshi vs State Of U.P. And 2 Others on 12 October, 2020 Bench: Shashi Kant Gupta, Pankaj Bhatia High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad ? Court No. - 32 Case :- Writ - C No. - 14782 of 2020 Petitioner :- Mohd Abbas Kureshi Respondent :- State Of U.P. And 2 Others Counsel for Petitioner :- Ravindra Pal Singh Kashyap,Akshay Kumar Shukla",
    "facts": "This writ petition, inter alia, has been filed for the following relief: \"1. To issue a writ or certiorari quashing the impugned order dated 21.03.2020 passed by respondent no. 2, Food Safety Officer, Bareilly (Under the Food Safety and Standard Act 2006), whereby the retain license of meat and meat products and poultry has been cancelled in arbitrary manner which was issued in favour of the petitioner on 05.02.2020 be [LEAKAGE_MASK] and [LEAKAGE_MASK] and the petitioner license be restored forthwith, in the interest of justice.\"",
    "arguments": "The main contention of the learned counsel for the petitioner is that the impugned order terminating his license has been passed without giving any opportunity of hearing to the petitioner. Sri B.P. Singh Kachhawah, learned Standing Counsel appearing on behalf of the State has rebutted the contention made by the learned counsel for the petitioner.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "The main contention of the learned counsel for the petitioner is that the impugned order terminating his license has been passed without giving any opportunity of hearing to the petitioner. Sri B.P. Singh Kachhawah, learned Standing Counsel appearing on behalf of the State has rebutted the contention made by the learned counsel for the petitioner.",
